<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - West Donegal Twp Auth, Pa.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - West Donegal Twp Auth, Pa.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hopper Soliday &amp; Co., Inc. said it received the written award for $2.575 million of West Donegal Township Authority, Pa., guaranteed sewer revenue bonds, Series of 1997, with a top yield of 5.519 percent in 2020.</p>
</text>
